{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>黃嘉雯近日在社交平台分享了一組在荷花池畔拍攝的古典風格寫真。相片中她身穿米金色繡花旗袍背心，盡顯高雅氣質。除了多張充滿仙氣的美照外，她更突發奇想頭戴「荷葉面具」並比出「V」字手勢。</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_1c4b452f8058f4d9-326\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><p id=\"p-rc_1c4b452f8058f4d9-326\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><p id=\"p-rc_1c4b452f8058f4d9-326\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>黃嘉雯亦在帖文中附上感性文字，借「蓮」寄意分享近期的處世心得：「李商隱寫蓮：卷舒開合任天真。🪷花開花合，從來唔為取悅邊個，只順住自己嘅節奏。人總係急，急住盛放，急住結果，但蓮教識我：合埋都可以好美，未開都可以有期待。😌」</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_1c4b452f8058f4d9-326\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"de8a11e3-2e04-4582-b9a2-425d91567edd.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026VuvWinSLzc1786349701.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"de8a11e3-2e04-4582-b9a2-425d91567edd.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p id=\"p-rc_1c4b452f8058f4d9-326\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"a7441660-9b32-4c55-8098-0f98b3895405.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026WehPW9zzg51786349716.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"a7441660-9b32-4c55-8098-0f98b3895405.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-14T01:20:08.463360+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":201,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}